Short description of your request
Install Python 3.11 on Self-Hosted Azure DevOps Agent (DEV)

Please tell us in detail about this request

We are setting up a new CI/CD pipeline to deploy Snowflake Streamlit applications to Snowflake.

For Snowflake Streamlit app container runtimes, Python 3.11 is the only currently supported version.

Reference: https://docs.snowflake.com/en/developer-guide/streamlit/app-development/runtime-environments

Could you please install Python 3.11.x on the self-hosted agent(s) in the dev-devops-linux-agent-pool and register it in the agent's tool cache so that it is available to the UsePythonVersion@0 pipeline task, alongside the existing Python 3.8.10 and 3.9.5 installations?

Scope: This request is for the DEV environment only. Once the installation is completed and successfully validated in DEV, we will raise separate service requests for the TEST and PROD environments.
